---
/** VISTA: the Alert → Task flow, drawn by hand. Styled by the .dg-* rules in caso.css. */
---

<figure id="flujo" class="figure-wide">
  <div class="diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1080 262" role="img" aria-label="Diagrama del flujo Alerta a Tarea. Camino principal: 1 llega la alerta, 2 revisa el impacto, 3 decide si actuar, 4 crea la tarea, 5 entra al tablero, 6 la marca completada y suma un logro de valor protegido. Si decide no actuar, 4b pide un motivo y la decisión queda registrada. Cancelar la tarea a medias también lleva a esa rama.">
      <defs>
        <marker id="dgA" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-head-a"></path></marker>
        <marker id="dgN" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-head-n"></path></marker>
      </defs>

      {/* camino principal */}
      <rect x="24" y="40" width="136" height="64" rx="8" class="dg-node"></rect>
      <text x="92" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Llega la alerta</text>
      <text x="92" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Panel y mapa</text>

      <rect x="210" y="40" width="136" height="64" rx="8" class="dg-node"></rect>
      <text x="278" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Revisa el impacto</text>
      <text x="278" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Tarjeta de alerta</text>

      <polygon points="396,72 448,32 500,72 448,112" class="dg-diamond"></polygon>
      <text x="448" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">¿Actuar?</text>

      <rect x="550" y="40" width="136" height="64" rx="8" class="dg-node"></rect>
      <text x="618" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Crea la tarea</text>
      <text x="618" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Ventana modal</text>

      <rect x="736" y="40" width="136" height="64" rx="8" class="dg-node"></rect>
      <text x="804" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Entra al tablero</text>
      <text x="804" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Tablero de tareas</text>

      <rect x="922" y="40" width="136" height="64" rx="8" class="dg-node"></rect>
      <text x="990" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Marca completada</text>
      <text x="990" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Tablero de tareas</text>

      <line x1="160" y1="72" x2="207" y2="72" class="dg-a" marker-end="url(#dgA)"></line>
      <text x="184" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">la abre</text>
      <line x1="346" y1="72" x2="393" y2="72" class="dg-a" marker-end="url(#dgA)"></line>
      <text x="370" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">decide</text>
      <line x1="500" y1="72" x2="547" y2="72" class="dg-a" marker-end="url(#dgA)"></line>
      <text x="524" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">sí</text>
      <line x1="686" y1="72" x2="733" y2="72" class="dg-a" marker-end="url(#dgA)"></line>
      <text x="710" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">envía</text>
      <line x1="872" y1="72" x2="919" y2="72" class="dg-a" marker-end="url(#dgA)"></line>
      <text x="896" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">cierra</text>

      {/* logro */}
      <line x1="990" y1="104" x2="990" y2="173" class="dg-a" marker-end="url(#dgA)"></line>
      <text x="998" y="145" class="dg-lbl">suma</text>
      <rect x="915" y="176" width="150" height="64" rx="32" class="dg-win"></rect>
      <text x="990" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Logro visible</text>
      <text x="990" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Sube el valor protegido</text>

      {/* rama "Ahora no" */}
      <line x1="448" y1="112" x2="448" y2="173" class="dg-n" marker-end="url(#dgN)"></line>
      <text x="456" y="148" class="dg-lbl">no, ahora no</text>
      <rect x="378" y="176" width="140" height="64" rx="8" class="dg-node-n"></rect>
      <text x="448" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Ahora no + motivo</text>
      <text x="448" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Ventana modal</text>

      <line x1="378" y1="208" x2="329" y2="208" class="dg-n" marker-end="url(#dgN)"></line>
      <text x="352" y="199" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">guarda</text>
      <rect x="176" y="176" width="150" height="64" rx="32" class="dg-term"></rect>
      <text x="251" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">Decisión registrada</text>
      <text x="251" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Sale del panel y el mapa</text>

      <path d="M618,104 V208 H521" class="dg-dash" marker-end="url(#dgN)"></path>
      <text x="570" y="226" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-lbl">cancela a medias</text>

      {/* números de paso */}
      <circle cx="24" cy="40" r="11" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="24" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">1</text>
      <circle cx="210" cy="40" r="11" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="210" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">2</text>
      <circle cx="448" cy="32" r="11" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="448" y="36" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">3</text>
      <circle cx="550" cy="40" r="11" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="550" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">4</text>
      <circle cx="736" cy="40" r="11" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="736" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">5</text>
      <circle cx="922" cy="40" r="11" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="922" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">6</text>
      <circle cx="378" cy="176" r="13" class="dg-badge"></circle><text x="378" y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-badge-t">4b</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="diagram-cap"><b>Todo pasa en una sola pantalla.</b> En verde, el camino de la alerta al logro en 6 pasos. En gris, las salidas: ninguna alerta se cierra sin una decisión.</figcaption>
</figure>
